# OpenSimulator modules, packaged as opensim-<core>-<module>, where <core> is a
# release (the last one of packaging/opensim-core.versions, or MODULES_CORE) or
# unstable, each in /usr/share/opensim-modules/<core>/<module>, not loaded
# until enabled.
# One line per file: module, core, module version (0.0~git<date>.<commit> for
# a snapshot of an unversioned source, <version>.<build>+git<date>.<commit> after
# the version the source declares, <build> being the number of commits of the
# source: two snapshots of the same day stay in order, and the first one sorts
# above the older <version>+git<date>.<commit> ones), packaging revision (the
# next one for any change to a published package), file: a path in this
# repository, or a URL followed by its SHA256 and the name to install.

# A DLL only works with the OpenSimulator it was built for, unstable is the commit of upstream/opensim
# OpenSimSearch 0.5 beta: the DLLs are built from modules/OpenSimSearch (the commit of the version) and kept in contrib/OpenSimSearch
# until a release holds them (then a URL, its SHA256 and the name, as the older ones had)
opensimsearch 0.9.2.2 0.5~beta.1+git20261007.068ae3a 1 contrib/OpenSimSearch/0.9.2.2/OpenSimSearch.Modules.dll
opensimsearch 0.9.3.0 0.5~beta.1+git20261007.068ae3a 1 contrib/OpenSimSearch/0.9.3.0/OpenSimSearch.Modules.dll
opensimsearch unstable 0.5~beta.1+git20261007.068ae3a 1 contrib/OpenSimSearch/unstable/OpenSimSearch.Modules.dll

